@startuml
title Diagrama de Secuencia - Seleccionar Recorrido

actor "Visitante" as Visitor
participant "MenuVisitor" as Menu
participant "GetRouteUseCase" as UC
participant "RouteRepository" as Repo
participant "FloorMapConsole" as Map

Visitor -> Menu: Seleccionar recorrido (id)
activate Menu
Menu -> UC: execute(id)
activate UC
UC -> Repo: findById(id)
activate Repo
Repo --> UC: route
deactivate Repo
UC --> Menu: route
deactivate UC
Menu --> Visitor: Mostrar detalle del recorrido

Visitor -> Menu: Iniciar Recorrido
Menu -> Map: start(route.getFirstSpace())
activate Map
Map --> Visitor: Mostrar mapa de la primera parada
deactivate Map
deactivate Menu

@enduml
